  "intro": "In Part 1 you learned hours, half past, and quarters. Now let's master precise minutes! For minutes PAST the hour, count minutes of the NEXT hour: 5:10 = десять минут шестого (10 minutes of the 6th). The word 'минут' changes by number: одна минута (1), две/три/четыре минуты (2-4), пять-двадцать минут (5-20). For minutes TO the hour, use без + genitive: 5:50 = без десяти шесть (without ten, six). In formal speech (trains, flights, news), Russia uses 24-hour format: 17:30 = семнадцать тридцать — just say the two numbers!",
